29:I[22016,["/_next/static/chunks/17a.6t9xikiiz.js","/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js"],""]
:HL["https://impulsedigital.co.in/ID-web-blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/social-medias-influence.jpg","image"]
2a:T5c82,<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6730 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/impact-of-online-engagement.jpg" alt="" width="617" height="415" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/impact-of-online-engagement.jpg 617w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/impact-of-online-engagement-300x202.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 617px) 100vw, 617px" /></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Have you cast your vote yet?</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> If not, this is your reminder to vote soon. The Lok Sabha Election 2024 happening in India is now the talk of the town. </span><span data-contrast="auto">Let&#8217;s dive into the topic for better and deeper understanding. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><i><span data-contrast="auto">Where have you been catching the latest updates and happenings? </span></i><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Paradigm Shift from Television to Smart Devices:</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Unlike in the olden days, when the elders were glued to the TV screens to catch the latest updates on the winning party or their favoured party, now we have the convenience of all-time updates at our fingertips.</span></p>
<div id="attachment_6715" style="width: 310px" class="wp-caption aligncenter"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-6715" class="wp-image-6715 size-medium" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/725025_news-paper5-1-300x300.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="300" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/725025_news-paper5-1-300x300.jpg 300w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/725025_news-paper5-1-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/725025_news-paper5-1-150x150.jpg 150w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/725025_news-paper5-1-768x768.jpg 768w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/725025_news-paper5-1-1536x1536.jpg 1536w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/725025_news-paper5-1-100x100.jpg 100w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/725025_news-paper5-1.jpg 1667w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /><p id="caption-attachment-6715" class="wp-caption-text"><a href="https://www.freepik.com/free-vector/man-reading-newspaper-his-mobile-phone_725025.htm#fromView=search&amp;page=4&amp;position=19&amp;uuid=fb654297-7a2f-4cdf-9cd9-3a37158e9c98" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source Credit</a></p></div>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">However, what&#8217;s the new generation doing? Or perhaps how has the older generation switched to mobiles to catch the same election 2024 updates?</span> <span data-contrast="auto">Yes, we have come a long way with the presence of <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/social-media-marketing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">social media</a>. </span><span data-contrast="auto">The consumption rate of mobile users has increased now far more than ever, with recent data that says, India has approximately 1.2 billion mobile users and along with </span><a href="https://www.livemint.com/technology/gadgets/india-has-over-1-2-bn-mobile-phone-users-i-b-ministry-11668610623295.html"><span data-contrast="none">600 million users</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> that use smartphones. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">TL: DR (Too long, didn&#8217;t read)</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559682&quot;:3,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1">Introduction to the upcoming Lok Sabha Election 2024</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559682&quot;:3,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1">Paradigm Shift from Television to Smart Devices – How have we evolved in terms of news consumption from TV to smart devices?</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559682&quot;:3,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1">The reliable presence of social media and how and why we all rely on social media today. It holds the world together.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559682&quot;:3,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1">Popular social media sites and applications like and how they have made sure to update us on elections 2024</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559682&quot;:3,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1">Goggle</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559682&quot;:3,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="6" data-aria-level="1">Instagram</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559682&quot;:3,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="7" data-aria-level="1">Twitter</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559682&quot;:3,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="8" data-aria-level="1">Brands in action – The role that brands play through their ads to inform us about recent happenings has proved useful to promote the brand as well as promoting contributing towards the responsibility towards the nation.</li>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559682&quot;:3,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="9" data-aria-level="1">Conclusion – The ever-growing presence of internet has made it possible to be more informed, heard and seen. It has given us a voice and become our voice. We urge fellow citizens to vote for Elections 2024.</li>
</ul>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/election-2024-from-the-branding-marketing-lens/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Election 2024: From the Branding &amp; Marketing Lens</a></p>
<h2>The Presence of Social Media</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The presence and power of social media are undoubtedly the supreme sources for information, entertainment, news and updates, learning, networking, and so much more. Likewise, the platform itself is a lovely way to reach out to your audience significantly be it a viral vada pav girl video from Delhi or recommendations from YouTubers around the world. We all rely on social media today. It holds the world together.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Let’s understand the presence of internet and social media applications in urging voters to vote: </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3>1: Google:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Goggle, being very important and visited by many users daily, has drawn attention to the elections too. According to the latest data of 2024, a whopping </span><a href="https://gs.statcounter.com/search-engine-market-share/all/india"><span data-contrast="none">98.06% of people use Goggle in India</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6716 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Election-2-ID-1024x368.png" alt="" width="660" height="237" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Election-2-ID-1024x368.png 1024w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Election-2-ID-300x108.png 300w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Election-2-ID-768x276.png 768w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Election-2-ID-1170x420.png 1170w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Election-2-ID.png 1309w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px" /></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">What a wonderful way to reach out to people who use Google daily! </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Such initiatives subconsciously make people aware of the latest happenings and serve as subtle reminders to do our duties towards our nation, too. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3><b><span data-contrast="auto">2: Instagram: </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Instagram, being the most used application online is popular among a wide share of audience, as of 2023; approximately there are </span><a href="https://www.forbes.com/advisor/in/business/social-media-statistics/#:~:text=In%20India%2C%20Instagram%20is%20the,active%20Instagram%20users%20in%20India."><span data-contrast="none">516.92 million users</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> active of Instagram. Imagine reaching out to so many audiences together. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">In addition to this, social media, being the foremost ground for connecting learning and deriving knowledge, takes it as a responsibility to educate and inform people on the latest updates and provides a bigger community to connect from and to catch the latest news and updates.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6717 size-medium" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/image-5-300x208.png" alt="" width="300" height="208" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/image-5-300x208.png 300w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/image-5-1024x709.png 1024w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/image-5-768x532.png 768w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/image-5.png 1480w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">This helps many people engage, spread and urge voters to take part in the most important events like Elections 2024. Adding election stickers helps the users stay in trend and be a wholesome part of a bigger and more responsible citizens group. It helps in deriving the right approach.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h4><span data-contrast="auto">Example: </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6719 " src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/elections.jpg" alt="" width="335" height="232" /></p>
<p><span class="TextRun SCXW251288791 BCX0" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW251288791 BCX0">Here’s</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW251288791 BCX0"> how </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW251288791 BCX0">Instagram also guides you to a page </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW251288791 BCX0">where you can catch the latest real-time updates and schedules, further informing you and provid</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW251288791 BCX0">ing a more </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW251288791 BCX0">informative</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW251288791 BCX0"> approach</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW251288791 BCX0">.  </span></span><span class="EOP SCXW251288791 BCX0" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6720 size-medium" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-161824_Instagram-1-3-e1713874195298-143x300.jpg" alt="" width="143" height="300" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-161824_Instagram-1-3-e1713874195298-143x300.jpg 143w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-161824_Instagram-1-3-e1713874195298-488x1024.jpg 488w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-161824_Instagram-1-3-e1713874195298-768x1611.jpg 768w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-161824_Instagram-1-3-e1713874195298-732x1536.jpg 732w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-161824_Instagram-1-3-e1713874195298-977x2048.jpg 977w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-161824_Instagram-1-3-e1713874195298.jpg 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 143px) 100vw, 143px" /></p>
<h3>3: Twitter</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">We can’t miss out on Twitter when it comes to current happenings. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><a href="https://twitter.com/ECISVEEP/status/1782370863251431679?t=FqF9zxUsV9RCkMFVTPNDPQ&amp;s=19" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter is flooded with election updates all over</a>. From hashtags like </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">#LokSabhaElections2024, #ChunavKaParv, #MyVoteMyVoice</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">, and so many others urging the users to go vote with many posts, tweets by fellow celebrities and popular personalities and politicians. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Example: </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6721 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot-6.png" alt="" width="583" height="944" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot-6.png 583w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot-6-185x300.png 185w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 583px) 100vw, 583px" /></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Brands being in action! </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Similarly, brands have come a long way in pertaining to the public interest and acting as a responsible part of social media. While we speak about social media, similarly several brands too have their marketing and kept their social media game strong. The popularity of social media has led brands to join the community online and be more seen and heard by their respective audience. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">From following the hashtag trend to very creatively using their brand or product to promote the message of the election. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h4>Example 1:</h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6722 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-170018_Instagram-1-1-300x296.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="296" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-170018_Instagram-1-1-300x296.jpg 300w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-170018_Instagram-1-1-1024x1012.jpg 1024w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-170018_Instagram-1-1-768x759.jpg 768w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-170018_Instagram-1-1-100x100.jpg 100w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-170018_Instagram-1-1.jpg 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<h4>Example 2:</h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6723 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-165938_Instagram-1-1-300x291.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="291" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-165938_Instagram-1-1-300x291.jpg 300w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-165938_Instagram-1-1-1024x992.jpg 1024w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-165938_Instagram-1-1-768x744.jpg 768w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-165938_Instagram-1-1.jpg 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<h4>Example 3:</h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6725 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-174109_Instagram-1-1-138x300.jpg" alt="" width="138" height="300" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-174109_Instagram-1-1-138x300.jpg 138w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-174109_Instagram-1-1-473x1024.jpg 473w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-174109_Instagram-1-1-768x1664.jpg 768w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-174109_Instagram-1-1-709x1536.jpg 709w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-174109_Instagram-1-1-945x2048.jpg 945w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Screenshot_20240419-174109_Instagram-1-1.jpg 1080w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 138px) 100vw, 138px" /></p>
<h4>Example 4:</h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-medium wp-image-6726 aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kaam-2-1-300x254.png" alt="" width="300" height="254" srcset="/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kaam-2-1-300x254.png 300w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kaam-2-1-470x400.png 470w, /blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/kaam-2-1.png 528w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">You&#8217;re bound to remember things you see often, like this pop-up ad &amp; Retargeting ads while using the applications. Such Ads not only remind you to vote but also draw your attention towards a specific party, which simply means how well they have done their marketing strategies, which draw public attention. </span></p>
<h2>Conclusion:</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The ever-growing presence of the internet has now made it necessary for brands to come into action. It has made it possible to be more informed, heard and seen. It has given us a voice and become our voice. This is how social media plays a positive role in consciously or subconsciously reminding us of our duties towards our nation. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="auto">Now is the time to vote! </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">We, the team at Impulse Digital- A <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/digital-marketing-agency-in-navi-mumbai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Digital marketing agency in Navi Mumbai</a>, urge all our readers to vote for our well-being and for the future of a developed and successful nation. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
